Z||000014||mshill||01-06-2000||03:53 AM||||Spyder,<P>I've been looking at the Lambo 5000S or 25th (non-stretched version) because my wife and kids really like the looks.  I would really like to find a Ferrari F50 but the Ferrari kits and reputable suppliers for them are hard to come by.<P>I wanted to start simple, but I am learning that 'simple' and 'Kit Car' cannot be used in the same sentence.  Whatever it tuens out to be I am not going to stretch the frame (not on the first one anyway).<BR>||||reg||10
Z||000015||Phil||01-06-2000||09:30 AM||||A Lambo is definately NOT the kit car to start on but there are some "bolt ons" that can be finished in under 100 hrs. Also be prepared to spend big $$. Plan on starting at $10,000 and going up for the finished product. Hope I made your day.||||reg||1
